@startuml ContainerX-Expanded
!define SUCCESS_COLOR #lightgreen
!define ERROR_COLOR #ffcccc
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam roundcorner 20
skinparam maxmessagesize 200
title ContainerX Full Workflow (Meter → Metal + Add-Ons)
actor "Dev/SME App" as APP #lightblue
box "ContainerX Backend" #lightgrey
  participant "Kong Gateway" as KONG
  participant "Auth Service" as AUTH
  participant "Wallet Check" as WALL
  participant "FastAPI Core" as API
  database "PostgreSQL" as DB
  participant "Kill Bill Billing" as KB
  participant "Meter Engine" as MTR
  participant "Monitoring (Prometheus/Grafana)" as MON
end box
database "Anonymized Data Lake" as LAKE
actor "External APIs (KRA/M-Pesa/NTSA/TransUnion)" as EXT #orange
actor "User Webhook" as WH
participant "Edge Container (Solar/K3s)" as EDGE #green
actor "Bank/FMCG Buyer" as BUYER #yellow
== Authentication ==
APP -> KONG: POST /auth {phone}
KONG -> AUTH: validate
AUTH -> EXT: M-Pesa OTP send/verify
EXT --> AUTH: OTP ok
AUTH -> APP: JWT (24h) [SUCCESS_COLOR]
== Metered Core Call (e.g., /invoice) ==
APP -> KONG: POST /invoice {data} + JWT
alt insufficient wallet
  KONG -> WALL: deduct 3.5 KES
  WALL -> KB: balance < fee
  KB --> APP: 402 Payment Required [ERROR_COLOR]
else sufficient
  KONG -> WALL: deduct 3.5 KES [SUCCESS_COLOR]
  WALL -> KB: ok → log to DB
  API -> EXT: POST KRA eTIMS (invoice JSON)
  EXT --> API: QR PNG url + validation
  API -> LAKE: SHA-256 anonymized (SKU, float)
  API -> WH: webhook invoice.validated
  API --> APP: 201 {qr_url} [SUCCESS_COLOR]
end
== Add-On Calls (V2) ==
APP -> API: POST /pay {txn} [SUCCESS_COLOR]
API -> EXT: Daraja C2B/B2B
EXT --> API: receipt
API -> WH: webhook pay.settled
APP -> API: GET /inventory {sku} [SUCCESS_COLOR]
API -> DB: qty/expiry query
API --> APP: 200 {data}
APP -> API: POST /dispatch {manifest} [SUCCESS_COLOR]
API -> EXT: NTSA PDF gen + OR-Tools opt
EXT --> API: PDF url
API -> WH: webhook dispatched
APP -> API: POST /co2 {km} [SUCCESS_COLOR]
API -> MTR: calc kg CO2e
MTR --> APP: 200 {kg}
APP -> API: POST /forecast {data} [SUCCESS_COLOR]
API -> MTR: PyTorch predict (sell-through)
MTR --> APP: 200 {predictions}
APP -> API: POST /backup [SUCCESS_COLOR]
API -> DB: MinIO snapshot
API --> APP: 202 {url}
APP -> API: GET /credit {hash} [SUCCESS_COLOR]
API -> EXT: TransUnion cache
EXT --> API: score
API --> APP: 200 {0-100}
== White-Label/Fork Flow ==
APP -> API: POST /white-label {fork_data} [SUCCESS_COLOR]
API -> KB: USD 120 + 6% GMV rake
API -> EDGE: ArgoCD deploy fork
EDGE --> APP: 201 {fork_url}
== Monitoring & Scaling ==
API -> MON: Prometheus metrics (uptime, calls)
MON -> APP: Public dashboard
alt scale needed
  API -> EDGE: K3s cluster auto-scale
  EDGE -> EXT: Starlink + solar power
end
== Data Flywheel & Monetization ==
LAKE -> MTR: aggregate (SKU velocity, liquidity)
MTR -> BUYER: Sell indices (e.g., Velocity-Index USD 250/mo) [SUCCESS_COLOR]
MTR -> KB: cron GMV rakes/carbon credits
== Error/Offline Pivot ==
note over APP, EDGE: Offline queue (Workbox sync) for POS apps
note over API: Pivot if KRA downtime >45d: Offline QR gen
@enduml